    "summary": "This model can't be your **WARLORD**.\n\nIn an **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** army, you can swap this model during the Declare Battle Formations step for another **OFFICIO ASSASSINORUM** model whose points value is no higher than this model's.\n\nDuplicate models aren't allowed, so after a swap your army can include at most 1 **VINDICARE ASSASSIN**, 1 **CULEXUS ASSASSIN**, 1 **EVERSOR ASSASSIN** and 1 **CALLIDUS ASSASSIN**.",
